@startuml
'!theme spacelab

component "Customer Service" as Customer
component "Orders Service" as Orders
component "Inventory Service" as Inventory

Customer --> Orders : mobile number
Orders <--> Inventory : serial number

note right of Orders
- Handles order lifecycle
- Receives mobile number from Customer
- Uses serial number to check Inventory
end note

note left of Customer
- Manages customer data
end note

note left of Inventory
- Manages guitar stock
end note

@enduml